    "type": "game",
    "name": "DOSTAVKA",
    "steam_appid": 3773750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/6bbe14cacbc86176a1730d2254e25392.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In DOSTAVKA, you\u2019ll have to survive an alien invasion \u2014 but even worse, survive a shift as a fast food worker!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your coworker forgot to put a drink in the order for an unsuspecting customer. Now, your only option is to chase down the delivery guy and save your spotless reputation as an underpaid student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/b32f2a4182fbe61958ef3b145b78fc70.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a hardcore 3D platformer with a funny story, unique levels, an original soundtrack by MOLINEA, and light but colorful visuals somewhere in Eastern Europe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Annoying random events!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/1acfa002d766434191ed4bbe4278137e.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete with friends using leaderboards!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/5da394cf2ac8c10a2fdbcff6b922b26d.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some dialogues \u2014 sometimes they\u2019re even not that embarrassing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/c1e3ddf1f980d0c5b6a7ea54af6c8318.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was originally developed as a single-player experience, but it also has a built-in online co-op mode for up to 4 players that doesn\u2019t work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But there\u2019s an arcade mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/7f6fbfb31e016d9d67089f2897943e79.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/73677a52c8ebaa295700f6aad92d4d66.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That also doesn\u2019t work, but you can still play it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new abilities: double jump, wall running, dash, rocket jump\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there are some Easter eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to run, jump, and pull off all kinds of moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is an alpha \u2014 we still have a lot to add. Promise!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/3a759d236be469f0b632b11d8844a1a2.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/6bbe14cacbc86176a1730d2254e25392.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In DOSTAVKA, you\u2019ll have to survive an alien invasion \u2014 but even worse, survive a shift as a fast food worker!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your coworker forgot to put a drink in the order for an unsuspecting customer. Now, your only option is to chase down the delivery guy and save your spotless reputation as an underpaid student.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/b32f2a4182fbe61958ef3b145b78fc70.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a hardcore 3D platformer with a funny story, unique levels, an original soundtrack by MOLINEA, and light but colorful visuals somewhere in Eastern Europe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Annoying random events!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/1acfa002d766434191ed4bbe4278137e.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete with friends using leaderboards!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/5da394cf2ac8c10a2fdbcff6b922b26d.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some dialogues \u2014 sometimes they\u2019re even not that embarrassing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/c1e3ddf1f980d0c5b6a7ea54af6c8318.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was originally developed as a single-player experience, but it also has a built-in online co-op mode for up to 4 players that doesn\u2019t work.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>But there\u2019s an arcade mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/7f6fbfb31e016d9d67089f2897943e79.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/73677a52c8ebaa295700f6aad92d4d66.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=412 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That also doesn\u2019t work, but you can still play it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new abilities: double jump, wall running, dash, rocket jump\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there are some Easter eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to run, jump, and pull off all kinds of moves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is an alpha \u2014 we still have a lot to add. Promise!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773750/extras/3a759d236be469f0b632b11d8844a1a2.avif?t=1754260294\" width=1600 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
